#.($114)Browse
#The \bBrowse\r command allows you to specify a new starting
#address for disassembly.
#You can specify an absolute
#address or a symbolic name (line number or label).
#.sp 1
#Note that if an absolute address is entered and the
#\l($117)Label-synch\m mode is off, the address may or may not
