#address.
#.sp 1
#Note that if \bLabel-synch\r mode is off, the specified or
#currently-highlighted address may or may not correspond to an
#instruction boundary and may result in an out-of-synch disassembly.
#.($118)Display/Alter|Expression
#The \bExpression\r command can be used to change the value of
