#.sp 1
#\l($359)LOGITECH^Mouse\m
#.sp 1
#\l($361)Mouse^Systems^White^Mouse\m
#.in -4 }
#.sp 1
#If your mouse is not listed above, refer to the mouse manufacturer's
#documentation.
#.sp 1
#Additionally, if you decide to use a mouse in this manner,
#you will probably prefer to set
#the \l($68)Alert|Bad^Key/Command\m toggle to \bOff\r.
