#bottom-right border of the window.  When you press \bCtrl-B\r
#the \l($476)Browse^Window\m will pop up allowing you to change or
#inspect the designated object.
#.sp 1
#The scope information displayed for a symbol is dependent
#on the type of symbol it is.  In general, the name of the
